,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-11T13:34:15Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T22:27:38Z","closed_at":"2026-09-11T22:25:27Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123415","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123415","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123415.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123415.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-11T22:25:27Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #123392\r\n\r\nIn #118309, I standardized the `get_minimum_size` implementation for \"basic\" `Container` types, but in doing so, I overrode the GDVirtual caller method, thereby killing all user-defined custom `Container` classes' implementations of `_get_minimum_size()`...\r\n\r\nThis fix moves it from overriding the GDVirtual caller method to creating a new method (`virtual Size2 get_minimum_size() const override` -> `Size2 _get_minimum_size() const`), and changes all caller sites to match. \r\n`AspectRatioContainer` and `GraphElement` had had theirs fully removed; they are added back as basic indirections. \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nIdeally, the `Control::get_minimum_size` and `Control::get_maximum_size` systems should be migrated to use the more standard GDVirtual implementation style, namely:\r\n```cpp\r\nSize2 Control::get_minimum_size() {\r\n  ERR_READ_THREAD_GUARD_V(Size2());\r\n  Size2 ms;\r\n  if (!GDVIRTUAL_CALL(_get_minimum_size, ms)) {\r\n    ms = _get_minimum_size();\r\n  }\r\n  return ms;\r\n}\r\n```\r\ninstead of the existing\r\n```cpp\r\nSize2 Control::get_minimum_size() const {\r\n  ERR_READ_THREAD_GUARD_V(Size2());\r\n  Vector2 ms;\r\n  GDVIRTUAL_CALL(_get_minimum_size, ms);\r\n  return ms;\r\n}\r\n```\r\nsuch that all engine subclasses would override a `virtual Size2 _get_minimum_size()` instead of the current `virtual Size2 get_minimum_size()` (which is our GDVirtual caller method). This would let all custom `Control` subclasses override their parent's implementation instead of only a few, and it would prevent this kind of breakage in the future. This is not in scope for this bug fix, and I will open a follow-up PR for it. ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123415/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123415/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}